#ASSERT `s 203(b)(6) the notice to the interested stockholders is timely` (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2026 7 20)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 203(b)(6) the notice to the interested stockholders is timely` (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2026 7 20))

-- (b)(7)
#ASSERT `s 203(b)(7) the restrictions do not apply because the stockholder became an interested stockholder when they did not apply` TRUE FALSE
