#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a limited liability limited partnership`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a statutory trust`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a business trust or association`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a real estate investment trust`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a common-law trust`
#ASSERT `s 203(c)(6) the kind of entity is a person` `a joint-stock association`
